ng></p><p>This bill prohibits federal funds from being&nbsp;used for construction or renovation in the White House, on White House grounds, or within any structure on White House grounds during a lapse in appropriations for a fiscal year (i.e., government shutdown) unless the&nbsp;construction or renovation is directly related to matters of health or safety.</p>","updateDate":"2025-10-23T13:05:53Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"BALL Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-12-02T09:05:58Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-12-02T09:05:58Z"}
